[2022-02-26T20:46:16+08:00][sql] UPDATE `carver_article`  SET `article_id` = 7 , `article_title` = '使用 PHP_XLSXWriter 代替 PHPExcel 10W+ 数据秒级导出' , `article_desc` = '使用 PHP_XLSXWriter 代替 PHPExcel 10W+ 数据秒级导出' , `article_content` = '<p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures;\">PHPExcel 是一个处理 Excel,CVS 文件的开源框架，它基于微软的 OpenXML 标准和 PHP 语言。可以使用它来读取、写入不同格式的电子表格，这也是 PHP 至今最通用的 Excel 处理工具，但是它有一个非常致命的缺点：特别占内存，对大批量的表格数据几乎会让人累觉不爱，处理速度非常慢，但是它功能非常丰富，API 非常多，所以在导出复杂格式的 Excel 表格时，你往往不得不使用它，真是让人又爱又恨。</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures;\">不幸的是，PHPExcel 官方已不再维护了这个项目了，官方团队在 github 上又起了一个新项目，叫 PhpSpreadsheet，新项目使用了大量的 php 新特性，比如命名空间，PSR 标准，性能也比 PHPExcel 高了不少。</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures;\">相比于 PHPExcel，PHP_XLSXWriter 是一个小而强悍的 Excel 读写插件，它并没有 PHPExcel 功能丰富，很多高级操作比如冻结表头，并不具备，但是它导出速度非常快，非常适合于数据量特别大，报表格式不是很复杂的导出需求，下图是官方的速度和内存测试</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures;\">PHP_XLSXWriter 如何使用？</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures;\">下载 (文档地址：https://xlswriter-docs.viest.me/zh-cn/an-zhuang)<br style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">这是 PHP_XLSXWriter 的 github 地址，当然大家也可以通过本地下载，你可以点击下载把它下载下来。解压之后你可以看到，它的核心文件只有一个: xlswriter.class.php，examples 目录为代码样例目录，里面有很多例子你可以参考。</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures;\">使用<br style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">对于日常中绝大部分的报表需求，PHP_XLSXWriter 是可以胜任的，下面通过一个例子来熟悉一下 API 的使用。假设我们要导出下图中的报表，并通过浏览器实现下载:</p><pre class=\"prettyprint\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 8px 16px 6px 56px; position: relative; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; overflow-y: hidden; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-color: rgb(245, 246, 247); border-left: none; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 245); z-index: 9; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures;\"><code class=\"prism language-php has-numbering\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(94, 102, 135); background: rgb(243, 244, 245); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.5em; display: block; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre; overflow-wrap: normal; min-width: 94%; text-size-adjust: none; word-break: break-all; position: unset;\">代码实现<span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; color: rgb(150, 152, 150); word-break: break-all; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;\">:</span>
<span class=\"token comment\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; color: rgb(150, 152, 150); word-break: break-all; font-style: italic !important; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif !important;\">//writer 类</span>
<span class=\"token variable\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; color: rgb(223, 80, 0); word-break: break-all; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;\">$writer</span> <span class=\"token operator\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; color: rgb(223, 80, 0); word-break: break-all; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; color: rgb(167, 29, 93); word-break: break-all; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: break-all; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;\">XLSXWriter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; color: rgb(150, 152, 150); word-break: break-all; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; color: rgb(150, 152, 150); word-break: break-all; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; color: rgb(150, 152, 150); word-break: break-all; font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;\">;</span>
